    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for suggestion! I've looked at your plugin: it is quite nice and simple. And the fact that it is older than any of 'mini.nvim' modules says a lot about its quality!\r\n\r\nI [have similar module in mind](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim#planned-modules), named 'mini.clue' (but I quite like the 'mini.menu' name, although it is even more ambiguous than 'mini.clue'). It has some specific goals and approaches in mind. There is some discussion about it in #118.\r\n\r\nSo I am afraid I am going to say no to this, sorry. Hope you'll still like and use 'mini.nvim' after that :)",
